From this we can see that if a gem is blue and can be engraved with, it must
be a sapphire. If you can't engrave with it, name it junk an chuck it away.

This is a table to determine the number of leters engraved for the bonus on the
weapon. Note that this is for sharp weapons only. So if you want to engrave
'Elbereth' with a +0 weapon, you will need to engrave in to goes (by adding to
the engraving.


Weapon bonus        number of letters
 -2   			3
 -1   			5
  0   			7
 +1   			9
 +2   			11

The above rules don't apply to athame. Other good things to engrave with are
the following rings: diamond, ruby, sapphire, emerald, topaz.
As well as wands (some better than others) and magic marker.

